    "sections": {
        "description": "Bosa Veterinary Care is a fast, lightweight WordPress theme for animal care, cats grooming, dog grooming, pet, pet care, pet center, pet shelter, pet shop, shelter, shop, salon, vet clinic, vet store, veterinarian, and veterinary startup sites, built for Elementor and WooCommerce. Launch your site visually - no code required. Built with SEO, speed, and usability in mind, Bosa Veterinary Care supports custom headers, footers, and mega menus with Elementor, and includes a full starter site you can import in one click. Works seamlessly with Elementor and Gutenberg, and stays compatible with major plugins like WooCommerce, Yoast, Contact Form 7, and Mailchimp. Bosa Veterinary Care also works with BEW, an Elementor addon offering widgets, templates, and AI-powered content generation."
